Policy CSP reference (Microsoft Learn, "Policy CSP" pages)
-----------------------------------------------------------

res/PolicyCsp.tsv.gz, which is embedded in PolicyVice.exe, contains setting names,
descriptions, allowed values and Group Policy mappings extracted from Microsoft's
Policy CSP reference documentation: the windows/client-management/mdm/policy-csp-*.md
files of the Windows client IT pro documentation.

